cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WitnessADR in research or a published system, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "WitnessADR: Tamper-Evident Audit Trail for AI Agent Decisions"
abstract: >
  WitnessADR is an open-source Python library that records AI agent decisions
  as a cryptographically hash-chained, Ed25519-signed Agent Decision Record (ADR)
  that any third party can independently verify without trusting the system that
  produced it. Designed to support EU AI Act, HIPAA, FINRA, and SOC 2 compliance
  logging requirements.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/witnessadr/witnessadr"
url: "https://witnessadr.github.io/witnessadr/"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-28"
keywords:
  - "AI agents"
  - "audit trail"
  - "tamper-evident logging"
  - "compliance"
  - "EU AI Act"
  - "hash chain"
  - "Ed25519"
  - "LangChain"
  - "agent decision record"
